IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User jcastellanos34@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass email/Mbsync-jcastellanos34@gmail.com"
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs PLAIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount gmail2
Host imap.gmail.com
User jcastellanosjoo@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass email/Mbsync-jcastellanosjoo@gmail.com"
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs PLAIN

IMAPStore gmail2-remote
Account gmail2

MaildirStore gmail2-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail2/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail2/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail2
Far :gmail2-remote:
Near :gmail2-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
